{
  "title": "Dua Mashlool",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Dua-e-Mashlool\r\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِیْمِ\r\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME \r\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\r\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِاسْمِكَ \r\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA BISMEKA \r\nO Allah, verily I beseech You by Your Name:\r\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِیْمِ \r\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME \r\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\r\nیَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَ الْاِكْرَامِ \r\nYAA ZALJALAALE WAL IKRAAME \r\nO Lord of majesty and honor!\r\nیَا حَیُّ یَا قَیُّوْمُ \r\nYAA HAYYO YAA QAYYOMO \r\nO Ever-living! O Self-subsistent!\r\nیَا حَیُّ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \r\nYAA HAYYO LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA \r\nO Ever-Living! There is no god but You!\r\nیَا هُوَ یَا مَنْ لَّا یَعْلَمُ مَا هُوَ \r\nYAA HOWA YAA MALLAA YA’LAMO MAA HOWA \r\nO He Whom none knows what He is,\r\nوَ لَا كَیْفَ هُوَ \r\nWA LAA KAIFA HOWA \r\nوَ لَا اَیْنَ هُوَ \r\nWA LAA AYNA HOWA \r\nnor where He is,\r\nوَ لَا حَیْثُ هُوَ اِلَّا هُوَ \r\nWA LAA HAYSO HOWA ILLAA HOWA \r\nnor in what respect He is, but He!\r\nیَا ذَا الْمُلْكِ وَ الْمَلَكُوْتِ \r\nYAA ZALMULKE WAL MALAKOOTE \r\nO Possessor of dominion and kingdom!\r\nیَا ذَا الْعِزَّۃِ وَ الْجَبَرُوْتِ \r\nYAA ZAL IZZATE WAL JABAROOTE \r\nO Possessor of might and invincibility!\r\nیَا مَلِكُ یَا قُدُّوْسُ یَا سَلَامُ \r\nYAA MALEKO YAA QUDDOOSE YAA SALAAMO \r\nO King! O All-holy! O Giver of peace!\r\nیَا مُؤْمِنُ یَا مُهَیْمِنُ \r\nYAA MOMENO YAA MOHAIMO \r\nO Granter of security! O All-preserver!\r\nیَا عَزِیْزُ یَا جَبَّارُ یَا مُتَكَبِّرُ \r\nYAA A'ZEEZO YAA JABBAARO YAA MUTAKABBERO \r\nO Almighty! O All-compeller! O All-sublime!\r\nیَا خَالِقُ یَا بَارِءُ یَا مُصَوِّرُ \r\nYAA KHAALEQO YAA BARE-O YAA MUSAWWERO \r\nO Creator! O Maker! O Shaper!\r\nیَا مُفِیْدُ یَا مُدَبِّرُ \r\nYAA MUFEEDO YAA MUDABBERO \r\nO grantor of Benefits! O Director!\r\nیَا شَدِیْدُ یَا مُبْدِءُ \r\nYAA SHADEEDO YAA MUBDEO \r\nO Severe (in punishing the evildoers)! O Originator!\r\nیَا مُعِیْدُ یَا مُبِیْدُ \r\nYAA MO-E’EEDO YAA MUBEEDO \r\nO Returner! O Destroyer!\r\nیَا وَدُوْدُ یَا مَحْمُوْدُ یَا مَعْبُوْدُ \r\nYAA WADOODO YAA MAHMOODO YAA MA’BOODO \r\nO All-loving! O All-praiseworthy! O All-worshipped!\r\nیَا بَعِیْدُ یَا قَرِیْبُ \r\nYAA BA-E’EEDO YAA QAREEBO \r\nO Far! O Nigh!\r\nیَا مُجِیْبُ یَا رَقِیْبُ یَا حَسِیْبُ \r\nYAA MUJEEBO YAA RAQEEBO YAA HASEEBO \r\nO Responder! O Watcher! O Reckoner!\r\nیَا بَدِیْعُ یَا رَفِیْعُ \r\nYAA BADEE-O YAA RAFEE-O' \r\nO Innovator! O Exalter!\r\nیَا مَنِیْعُ یَا سَمِیْعُ \r\nYAA MANEE-O' YAA SAMEE-O'\r\nO Inaccessible! O All-hearing!\r\nیَا عَلِیْمُ یَا حَلِیْمُ یَا كَرِیْمُ \r\nYAA A’LEEMO YAA HALEEMO YAA KAREEMO \r\nO All-knowing! O All-clement! O All-generous!\r\nیَا حَكِیْمُ یَا قَدِیْمُ \r\nYAA HAKEEMO YAA QADEEMO \r\nO All-wise! O Eternal!\r\nیَا عَلِیُّ یَا عَظِیْمُ \r\nYAA A’LEEYO YAA A’ZEEMO \r\nO All-high! O All-tremendous!\r\nیَا حَنَّانُ یَا مَنَّانُ \r\nYAA HANNAANO YAA MANNAANO \r\nO All-commiserating! O All-gracious!\r\nیَا دَیَّانُ یَا مُسْتَعَانُ \r\nYAA DAYYAANO YAA MUSTA’AANO \r\nO Condemner! O Recourse!\r\nیَا جَلِیْلُ یَا جَمِیْلُ \r\nYAA JALEELO YAA JAMEELO \r\nO All-majestic! O All-handsome!\r\nیَا وَكِیْلُ یَا كَبِیْلُ \r\nYAA WAKEELO YAA KAFEELO \r\nO Guardian! O Surety!\r\nیا مُقِیْلُ یَا مُنِیْلُ \r\nYAA MUQEELO YAA MUNEELO \r\nO Annuller! O Bestower!\r\nیَا نَبِیْلُ یَا دَلِیْلُ \r\nYAA NABEELO YAA DALEELO \r\nO All-noble! O Leader!\r\nیَا هَادِیُ یَا بَادِیُ \r\nYAA HAADEE YAA BAADEE \r\nO Guide! O All-Apparent!\r\nیَا اَوَّلُ یَا آخِرُ \r\nYAA AWWALO YAA AAKHERO \r\nO First! O Last!\r\nیَا ظَاهِرُ یَا بَاطِنُ \r\nYAA ZAAHERO YAA BAATENO \r\nO Outward! O Inward!\r\nیَا قَآئِمُ یَا دَآئِمُ \r\nYAA QAAEMO YAA DAAEMO \r\nO All-steadfast! O Everlasting!\r\nیَا عَالِمُ یَا حَاكِمُ \r\nYAA A’AALEMO YAA HAAKEMO \r\nO Knower! O Decider!\r\nیَا قَاضِیْ یَا عَادِلُ \r\nYAA QAAZEE YAA A’AADELO \r\nO Judge! O Just!\r\nیَا فَاصِلُ یَا وَاصِلُ \r\nYAA FAASELO YAA WAASELO \r\nO Separator! O Joiner!\r\nیَا طَاهِرُ یَا مُطَهِّرُ \r\nYAA TAAHERO YAA MOTAHHERO \r\nO Pure! O Purifier!\r\nیَا قَادِرُ یَا مُقْتَدِرُ \r\nYAA QAADERO YAA MUQTADERO \r\nO All-powerful! O All-able!\r\nیَا كَبِیْرُ یَا مُتَكَبِّرُ \r\nYAA KABEERO YAA MOTAKABBERO \r\nO All-great! O All-sublime!\r\nیَا وَاحِدُ یَا اَحَدُ یَا صَمَدُ \r\nYAA WAAHEDO YAA AHADO YAA SAMADO \r\nO One! O Unique! O eternally Besought of all!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَّمْ یَلِدْ وَ لَمْ یُوْلَدْ \r\nYAA MAN LAM YALID WALAM YOOLAD \r\nO He Who begets not and was not begotten,\r\nوَ لَمْ یَكُنْ لَّهٗ كُفُوًا اَحَدٌا \r\nWA LAM YAKUL LAHU KOFO-WAN AHADUN \r\nequal to Whom is none,\r\nوَ لَمْ یَكُنْ لَّهٗ صَاحِبَۃٌ \r\nWA LAM YAKUL LAHU SAAHEBATUN \r\nWho has no consort,\r\nوَ لَا كَانَ مَعَهٗ وَزِیْرٌ \r\nWA LAA KAANA MA’AHOO WAZEERUN \r\nwith Him is no aide\r\nوَلَا اتَّخَذَ مَعَهٗ مُشِیْرًا \r\nWA LAT-TAKHAZA MA’AHOO MUSHEERAN \r\nnor has He taken any adviser,\r\nوَ لَا احْتَاجَ اِلٰی ظَهِیْرٍ \r\nWA LAAH TAAJA ELAA ZAHEERIN \r\nnor needs He any assistant,\r\nوَّ لَا كَانَ مَعَهٗ مِنْ اِلٰهٍ غَیْرُهٗ \r\nWA LAA KAANAA MAHOO MIN ILAAHIN GHAIROHU\r\nnor with Him is any god but He—\r\nلَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ \r\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA \r\nthere is no god but You.\r\nفَتَعَالَیْتَ عَمَّا یَقُوْلُ الظَّالِمُوْنَ عُلُوًّا كَبِیْرًا \r\nFATA’AALAYTA A’MMAA YAQOOLUZ ZAALEMOONA U’LOOWAN KABEERAN \r\nSo exalted are You above what the evildoers say, a great exaltation!\r\nیَا عَلِیُّ یَا شَامِخُ یَا بَاذِخُ \r\nYAA A’LEEYO YAA SHAAMEKHO YAA BAAZEKHO \r\nO All-high! O All-lofty! O All-towering!\r\nیَا فَتَّاحُ یَا نَفَّاحُ یَا مُرْتَاحُ \r\nYAA FATTAAHO YAA NAFFAAHO YAA MURTAAHO \r\nO All-opener! O All-diffuser! O All-restful!\r\nیَا مُفَرِّجُ یَا نَاصِرُ یَا مُنْتَصِرُ \r\nYAA MUFARREJO YAA NAASERO YAA MUNTASERO \r\nO Bestower of relief! O Helper! O Giver of victory!\r\nیَا مُدْرِكُ یَا مُهْلِكُ یَا مُنْتَقِمُ \r\nYAA MUDREKO YAA MUHLEKO YAA MUNTAQEMO \r\nO Comprehender! O Destroyer! O Avenger!\r\nیَا بَاعِثُ یَا وَارِثُ \r\nYAA BAA-E’SO YAA WAARESO \r\nO Upraiser! O Inheritor!\r\nیَا طَالِبُ یَا غَالِبُ \r\nYAA TAALEBO YAA GHAALEBO \r\nO Seeker! O Vanquisher!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَّا یَفُوْتُهٗ هَارِبٌ \r\nYAA MAL LAA YAFOOTOHU HAAREBUN \r\nO He from Whom no fugitive can escape!\r\nیَا تَوَّابُ یَا اَوَّابُ یَا وَهَّابُ \r\nYAA TAWWAABO YAA AWWAABO YAA WAHHAABO \r\nO All-relenting! O All-forbearing! O All-bestower!\r\nیَا مُسَبِّبَ الْاَسْبَابِ \r\nYAA MOSABBEBAL ASBAABE \r\nO Originator of all means!\r\nیَا مُفَتِّحَ الْاَبْوَابِ \r\nYAA MUFATTEHAL ABWAABE \r\nO Opener of all doors!\r\nیَا مَنْ حَیْثُ مَا دُعِیَ اَجَابَ \r\nYAA MAN HAISO MAA DO-E’YA AJAABA \r\nO He Who answers wherever He is called upon!\r\nیَا طَهُوْرُ یَا شَكُوْرُ \r\nYAA TAHOORO YAA SHAKOORO \r\nO All-Pure! O All-thankful!\r\nیَا عَفُوُّ یَا غَفُوْرُ \r\nYAA A’FOO-O YAA GHAFOORO \r\nO Exempter! O Forgiver!\r\nیَا نُوْرَ النُّوْرِ \r\nYAA NOORAN NOORE \r\nO Light of light!\r\nیَا مُدَبِّرَ الْاُمُوْرِ \r\nYAA MUDABBERAL OMOORE \r\nO Director of all affairs!\r\nیَا لَطِیْفُ یَا خَبِیْرُ \r\nYAA LADEEFO YAA KHABEERO \r\nO All-subtle! O All-aware!\r\nیَا مُجِیْرُ یَا مُنِیْرُ \r\nYAA MOJEERO YAA MONEERO \r\nO Protector! O Illuminator!\r\nیَا بَصِیْرُ یَا ظَهِیْرُ یَا كَبِیْرُ \r\nYAA BASEERO YAA ZAHEERO YAA KABEERO \r\nO All-seeing! O All-aiding! O All-great!\r\nیَا وِتْرُ یَا فَرْدُ \r\nYAA WITRO YAA FARDO \r\nO Alone! O Solitary!\r\nیَا اَبَدُ یَا سَنَدُ یَا صَمَدُ \r\nYAA ABADO YAA SANADO YAA SAMADO \r\nO Eternity without end! O Support! O Everlasting Refuge!\r\nیَا كَافِیْ یَا شَافِیْ \r\nYAA KAAFEE YAA SHAAFEE \r\nO All-sufficient! O All-healing!\r\nیَا وَافِیْ یَا مُعَافِیْ \r\nYAA WAAFEE YAA MO-A’AFEE \r\nO All-fulfilling! O All-relieving!\r\nیَا مُحْسِنُ یَا مُجْمِلُ \r\nYAA MOHSENO YAA MUJMELO \r\nO All-kind! O All-gracious!\r\nیَا مُنْعِمُ یَا مُفْضِلُ \r\nYAA MUN-E’MO YAA MUFZELO \r\nO All-benevolent! O All-bountiful!\r\nیَا مُتَكَرِّمُ یَا مُتَفَرِّدُ \r\nYAA MOTAKARREMO YAA MOTAFARREDO \r\nO All-beneficent! O All-solitary!\r\nیَا مَنْ عَلَا فَقَهَرَ \r\nYAA MAN A’LAA FAQAHARA \r\nO He Who is exalted and dominates!\r\nیَا مَنْ مَلَكَ فَقَدَرَ \r\nYAA MAN MALAKA FAQADARA \r\nO He Who is master and exercises power!\r\nیَا مَنْ بَطَنَ فَخَبَرَ \r\nYAA MAN BATANA FAKHABARA \r\nO He Who is inward and aware!\r\nیَا مَنْ عُبِدَ فَشَكَرَ \r\nYAA MAN O’BEDA FA-SHAKARA \r\nO He Who is worshipped and thankful!\r\nیَا مَنْ عُصِیَ فَغَفَرَ \r\nYAA MAN O’SEYA FAGHAFARA \r\nO He Who is disobeyed and forgives!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَّا تَحْوِیْهِ الْفِكَرُ \r\nYAA MAL LAA TAHVEEHIL FEKARO \r\nO He Who is not encompassed by thoughts,\r\nوَ لَا یُدْرِكُهٗ بَصَرٌ \r\nWA LAA YUDREKOHU BASARUN \r\nnor perceived by vision,\r\nوَ لَا یَخْفٰی عَلَیْهِ اَثَرٌ \r\nWA LAA YAKHFAA A’LAYHE ASARUN \r\nand from Whom no trace remains hidden!\r\nیَا رَازِقَ الْبَشَرِ \r\nYAA RAAZEQAL BASHARE \r\nO Provider of mankind!\r\nیَا مُقَدِّرَ كُلِّ قَدَرٍ \r\nYAA MUQADDERA KULLE QADARIN \r\nO Determiner of every lot!\r\nیَا عَالِیَ الْمَكَانِ \r\nYAA A’ALEYAL MAKAANE \r\nO Lofty in place!\r\nیَا شَدِیْدَ الْاَرْكَانِ \r\nYAA SHADEEDAL ARKAANE \r\nO Firm in supports!\r\nیَا مُبَدِّلَ الزَّمَانِ \r\nYAA MUBADDELAZ ZAMAANE \r\nO Transformer of times!\r\nیَا قَابِلَ الْقُرْبَانِ \r\nYAA QAABELAL QURBAANE \r\nO Accepter of sacrifices!\r\nیَا ذَا الْمَنِّ وَ الْاِحْسَانِ \r\nYAA ZAL MANNE WAL EHSAANE \r\nO Lord of graciousness and benevolence!\r\nیَا ذَا الْعِزَّۃِ وَ السُّلْطَانِ \r\nYAA ZAL I'ZZATE WAS SULTAANE \r\nO Lord of might and force!\r\nیَا رَحِیْمُ یَا رَحْمٰنُ \r\nYAA RAHEEMO YAA RAHMAANO\r\nO All-compassionate! O All-merciful!\r\nیَا مَنْ هُوَ كُلَّ یَوْمٍ فِیْ شَاْنٍ \r\nYAA MAN HOWA KULLE YAWMIN FEE SHANIN \r\nO He Who is every day upon some labor!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَّا یَشْغَلُهٗ شَاْنٌ عَنْ شَاْنٍ \r\nYAA MAN LAA YASHGHALOHU SHANUN A’N SHANIN \r\nO He Who is not distracted from one labor by another!\r\nیَا عَظِیْمَ الشَّاْنِ \r\nYAA A’ZEEMASH SHAANE\r\nO Tremendous in rank!\r\nیَا مَنْ هُوَ بِكُلِّ مَكَانٍ \r\nYAA MAN WA BEKULLE MAKAANIN \r\nO He Who is in every place!\r\nیَا سَامِعَ الْاَصْوَاتِ \r\nYAA SAAMEA’L ASWAATE \r\nO He Who hears all sounds!\r\nیَا مُجِیْبَ الدَّعْوَاتِ \r\nYAA MOJEEBAD DA’WAATE \r\nO He Who answers all supplications!\r\nیَا مُنْجِحَ الطَّلِبَاتِ \r\nYAA MUNJEHAT TALEBAATE \r\nO He Who fulfils all entreaties!\r\nیَا قَاضِیَ الْحَاجَاتِ \r\nYAA QAAZEYAL HAAJAATE \r\nO He Who provides all needs!\r\nیَا مُنْزِلَ الْبَرَكَاتِ \r\nYAA MUNZELAL BARAKAATE \r\nO He Who sends down blessings!\r\nیَا رَاحِمَ الْعَبَرَاتِ \r\nYAA RAAHEMAL A’BARAATE \r\nO He Who has mercy upon tears!\r\nیَا مُقِیْلَ الْعَثَرَاتِ \r\nYAA MOQEELAL A’SARAATE \r\nO He Who annuls slips!\r\nیَا كَاشِفَ الْكُرُبَاتِ \r\nYAA KAASHEFAL KOROBAATE \r\nO He Who removes troubles!\r\nیَا وَلِیَّ الْحَسَنَاتِ \r\nYAA WALIYYAL HASANAATE \r\nO He Who sponsors good things!\r\nیَا رَافِعَ الدَّرَجَاتِ \r\nYAA RAAFE-A’D DARAJAATE \r\nO He Who exalts in rank!\r\nیَا مُؤْتِیَ السُّؤْلَاتِ \r\nYAA MOATEYAS SOALAATE \r\nO He Who bestows requests!\r\nیَا مُحْیِیَ الْاَمْوَاتِ \r\nYAA YAA MOHYEYAL AMWAATE \r\nO He Who gives life to the dead!\r\nیَا جَامِعَ الشَّتَاتِ \r\nYAA JAAMEA’SH SHATAATE \r\nO He Who gathers all scattered things!\r\nیَا مُطَّلِعًا عَلَی النِّیَّاتِ \r\nYAA MUTTALEAN A’LAN NIYYAATE \r\nO He Who is aware of all intentions!\r\nیَا رَآدَّ مَا قَدْ فَاتَ \r\nYAA RAADDA MAA QAD FAATA \r\nO He Who brings back what has passed away!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَّا تَشْتَبِهُ عَلَیْهِ الْاَصْوَاتُ \r\nYAA MAN LAA TASHTABEHO A’LAYHIL ASWAATO \r\nO He for Whom sounds are never indistinct!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَّا تُضْجِرُهُ الْمَسْئَلَاتُ \r\nYAA MAL LAA TUZJEROHUL MAS-ALAATO \r\nO He Who never becomes annoyed at requests\r\nوَلَا تَغْشَاهُ الظُّلُمَاتُ \r\nWA LAA TAGSHAAHUZ ZOLOMAATO \r\nnor covered by shadows!\r\nیَا نُوْرَ الْاَرْضِ وَ السَّمٰوٰتِ \r\nYAA NOORAL ARZE WAS SAMAWAATE \r\nO Light of the earth and the heavens!\r\nيَا سَابِغَ النِّعَمِ \r\nYAA SAABEGAN NE-A’ME \r\nO Ample in blessings!\r\nیَا دَافِعَ النِّقَمِ \r\nYAA DAAFE-AN NEQAME \r\nO Repeller of adversities!\r\nیَا بَارِءَ النَّسِمَ \r\nYAA BAARE-AN NASAME \r\nO Maker of the breaths of life!\r\nیَا جَامِعَ الْاُمَمِ \r\nYAA JAAME-A'L OMAME \r\nO He Who gathers together the nations!\r\nیَا شَافِیَ السَّقَمِ \r\nYAA SHAAFEYAS SAQAME \r\nO Healer of illnesses!\r\nیَا خَالِقَ النُّوْرِ وَ الظُّلَمِ \r\nYAA KHAALEQAN NOORE WAZ ZOLAME \r\nO Creator of light and darkness!\r\nیَا ذَا الْجُوْدِ وَالْكَرَمِ \r\nYAA ZAL JOODE WAL KARAME \r\nO Lord of munificence and generosity!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَا یَطَاُ عَرْشَهٗ قَدَمٌ \r\nYAA MAL LAA YATA-A A’RSHAHU QADAMUN \r\nO He upon Whose Throne no foot treads!\r\nیَا اَجْوَدَ الْاَجْوَدِیْنَ \r\nYAA AJWADAL AJWADEENA \r\nO Most Munificent of the most munificent!\r\nیَا اَكْرَمَ الْاَكْرَمِیْنَ \r\nYAA AKRAMAL AKRAMEENA \r\nO Most Generous of the most generous!\r\nیَا اَسْمَعَ السَّامِعِیْنَ \r\nYAA ASMA-A'S SAAME’EENA \r\nO Most Hearing of the hearers!\r\nیَا اَبْصَرَ النَّاظِرِیْنَ \r\nYAA ABSARAN NAAZEREENA \r\nO Most Seeing of the viewers!\r\nیَا جَارَ الْمُسْتَجِیْرِیْنَ \r\nYAA JAARAL MUSTAJEEREENA \r\nO Protector of those who seek protection!\r\nیَا اَمَانَ الْخَآئِفِیْنَ \r\nYAA AMAANAL KHAA-EFEENA \r\nO Sanctuary of the fearful!\r\nیَا ظَهْرَ اللَّاجِیْنَ \r\nYAA ZAHRAL LAAJEENA \r\nO Asylum of the refugees!\r\nیَا وَ لِیَّ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \r\nYAA WALIYYAL MOMENEENA \r\nO Patron of the believers!\r\nیَا غِیَاثَ الْمُسْتَغِیْثِیْنَ \r\nYAA GHEYAASAL MUSTAGESEENA \r\nO Helper of those who seek aid!\r\nیَا غَایَۃَ الطَّالِبِیْنَ \r\nYAA GAAYATAT TAALEBEENA \r\nO Goal of the seekers!\r\nیَا صَاحِبَ كُلِّ غَرِیْبٍ \r\nYAA SAAHEBA KULLE GHAREEBIN \r\nO Companion of every stranger!\r\nیَا مُوْنِسَ كُلِّ وَحِیْدٍ \r\nYAA MOONESA KULLE WAHEEDIN \r\nO Intimate of everyone alone!\r\nیَا مَلْجَاءَ كُلِّ طَرِیْدٍ \r\nYAA MALJA-A KULLE TAREEDIN \r\nO Refuge of every outcast!\r\nیَا مَاْوٰی كُلِّ شَرِیْدٍ \r\nYAA MA-WAA KULLE SHAREEDIN \r\nO Shelter of every wanderer!\r\nیَا حَافِظَ كُلِّ ضَآلَّۃٍ \r\nYAA HAAFEZA KULLE ZALLATIN \r\nO Custodian of everyone astray!\r\nیَا رَاحِمَ الشَّیْخِ الْكَبِیْرِ \r\nYAA RAHEMASH SHAIKHIL KABEERA \r\nO He Who is merciful to old men!\r\nیَا رَازِقَ الطِّفْلِ الصَّغِیْرِ \r\nYAA RAAZEQAT TIFLIS SAGHEERE \r\nO He Who provides for small infants!\r\nیَا جَابِرَ الْعَظْمِ الْكَسِیْرِ \r\nYAA JAABERAL A’ZMIL KABEERE \r\nO He Who sets broken bones!\r\nیَا فَاكَّ كُلِّ اَسِیْرٍ \r\nYAA FAAKKA KULLE ASEERIN \r\nO He Who releases every prisoner!\r\nیَا مُغْنِیَ الْبَآئِسِ الْفَقِیْرِ \r\nYAA MUGHNEYAL BAAA-ESIL FAQEERE \r\nO He Who enriches the miserable pauper!\r\nیَا عِصْمَۃَ الْخَآئِفِ الْمُسْتَجِیْرِ \r\nYAA I’SMATIL KHAAE-FIL MUSTAJEERE\r\nO He Who safeguards the fearful seeker of protection!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَهُ التَّدْبِیْرُ وَ التَّقْدِیْرُ \r\nYAA MAN LAHUT TADBEERO WAT TAQDEERO \r\nO He Who governs and determines!\r\nیَا مَنِ الْعَسِیْرُ عَلَیْهِ سَهْلٌ یَسِیْرٌ \r\nYAA MANIL A’SEERO A’LAIHE SAHLUN YASEERUN \r\nO He for Whom the difficult is simple and easy!\r\nیَا مَنْ لَا یَحْتَاجُ اِلٰی تَفْسِیْرٍ \r\nYAA MAL LAA YAHTAAJO ELAA TAFSEERIN \r\nO He Who never needs an explanation!\r\nیَا مَنْ هُوَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٌ \r\nYAA MAN HOWA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN \r\nO He Who is powerful over everything!'\r\nیَا مَنْ هُوَ بِكُلِّ شَیْءٍ خَبِیْرٌ \r\nYAA MAN HOWA BEKULLE SHAI-IN KHABEERUN \r\nO He Who is aware of everything!\r\nیَا مَنْ هُوَ بِكُلِّ شَیْءٍ بَصِیْرٌ \r\nYAA MAN HOWA BEKULLE SHAI-IN BASEERUN \r\nO He Who sees everything!\r\nیَا مُرْسِلَ الرِّیَاحِ \r\nYAA MURSELAR REYAAHE \r\nO Sender of the winds!\r\nیَا فَالِقَ الْاَصْبَاحِ \r\nYAA FAALEQAL ISBAAHE \r\nO Cleaver of the dawn!\r\nیَا بَاعِثَ الْاَرْوَاحِ \r\nYAA BAA-ESAL ARWAAHE \r\nO Dispatcher of the spirits!\r\nیَا ذَا الْجُوْدِ وَ السَّمَآحِ \r\nYAA ZAL-JOODE WAS SAMAA-HE \r\nO Lord of munificence and forbearance!\r\nیَا مَنْ بِیَدِهٖ كُلُّ مِفْتَاحٍ \r\nYAA MAN BEYADEHEE KULLE MIFTAAHIN \r\nO He in Whose Hand is every key!\r\nیَا سَامِعَ كُلِّ صَوْتٍ \r\nYAA SAAME-A KULLE SAWTIN \r\nO He Who hears every sound!\r\nیَا سَابِقَ كُلِّ فَوْتٍ \r\nYAA SAABEQA KULLE FAWTIN \r\nO He Who takes precedence over everything that passes away!\r\nیَا مُحْیِیَ كُلِّ نَفْسٍ بَعْدَ الْمَوْتِ \r\nYAA MOHYEYA KULLE NAFSIN BA’DAL MAWTE \r\nO He Who gives life to every soul after death!\r\nیَا عُدَّتِیْ فِیْ شِدَّتِیْ \r\nYAA UDDATEE FEE SHIDDATEE \r\nO my Provision in my hardship!\r\nیَا حَافِظِیْ فِیْ غُرْبَتِیْ \r\nYAA HAAFEZEE FEE GHURBATEE \r\nO my Maintainer in my exile!\r\nیَا مُوْنِسِیْ فِیْ وَحْدَتِیْ \r\nYAA MOONESEE FEE WAHDATEE \r\nO my Intimate in my lonesomeness!\r\nیَا وَلِیِّ فِیْ نِعْمَتِیْ \r\nYAA WALI-EE FEE NE-A’MATEE \r\nO my Sponsor in my blessings!\r\nیَا كَهْفِیْ حِیْنَ تُعْیِیْنِیْ الْمَذَاهِبُ \r\nYAA KAHFEE HEENA TOA’EENIL MAZAAHEBO \r\nO my haven when the ways make me weary,\r\nوَ تُسَلِّمُنِی الْاَقَارِبُ \r\nWA TOSALLEMONIL AQAAREBO \r\nwhen relatives give me up\r\nوَ یَخْذُلُنِیْ كُلُّ صَاحِبٍ \r\nWA YAKHZOLONEE KULLO SAAHEBIN \r\nand when every companion forsakes me!\r\nیَا عِمَادَ مَنْ لَا عِمَادَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA E’MAADA MAL LAA E’MAADA LAHU \r\nO Backing of him who has no backing!\r\nیَا سَنَدَ مَنْ لَا سَنَدَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA SANADA MAL LAA SANADA LAHU \r\nO Support of him who has no support!\r\nیَا ذُخْرَ مَنْ لَا ذُخْرَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA ZUKHRA MAL LAA ZUKHRA LAHU \r\nO Store of him who has no store!\r\nیَا حِرْزَ مَنْ لَا حِرْزَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA HIRZA MAL LAA HIRZA LAHU \r\nO Sanctuary of him who has no sanctuary!\r\nیَا كَهْفَ مَنْ لَا كَهْفَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA KAHFA MAL LAA KAHFA LAHU \r\nO Cave of him who has no cave!\r\nیَا كَنْزَ مَنْ لَا كَنْزَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA KANZA MAL LAA KANZA LAHU \r\nO Treasure of him who has no treasure!\r\nیَا رُكْنَ مَنْ لَا رُكْنَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA RUKNA MAL LAA RUKNA LAHU \r\nO castle of him who has no castle!\r\nیَا غِیَاثَا مَنْ لَاغِیَاثَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA GHEYAASA MAL LAA GHEYAASA LAHU \r\nO Help of him who has no help!\r\nیَا جَارَ مَنْ لَا جَارَ لَهٗ \r\nYAA JAARA MAL LAA JAARA LAHU \r\nO backer of him who has no backer!\r\nیَا جَارِیَ اللَّصِیْقَ  یَا رُكْنِیَ الْوَثِیْقَ \r\nYAA JAAREYAL LASEEQO YAA RUKNEYAL WASEEQA \r\nO my Adjacent Neighbor! O my Sturdy Pillar!\r\nیَا اِلٰهِیْ بِالتَّحْقِیْقِ \r\nYAA ILAAHEE BITTAHQEEQE \r\nO My God in truth!\r\nیَا رَبَّ الْبَیْتِ الْعَتِیْقِ \r\nYAA RABBAL BAITIL A’TEEQA \r\nO Lord of the Ancient House!\r\nیَا شَفِیْقُ یَا رَفِیْقُ \r\nYAA SHAFEEQO YAA RAFEEQO \r\nO All-affectionate! O Friend!\r\nفُكَّنِیْ مِنْ حَلَقِی الْمَضِیْقِ \r\nFUKKANEE MAIN HALAQIL MAZEEQE \r\nDeliver me from the chains of strictures,\r\nوَ اصْرِفْ عَنِّیْ كُلَّ هَمٍّ وَّ غَمٍّ وَّ ضِیْقٍ \r\nWA ASRIF A’NNEE KULLE HAMMIN WA GHAMMIN WA ZEEQIN\r\nturn away from me every care, grief and distress,\r\nوَّ اكْفِنِیْ شَرَّ مَا لَا اُطِیْقُ \r\nWAKFENEE SHARRA MAA LAA OTEEQO \r\nprotect me from the evil of that which I cannot bear,\r\nوَ اَعِنِّیْ عَلٰی مَا اُطِیْقُ \r\nWA A-I’NNEE A’LAA MAA OTEEQO \r\nand help me in that which I am able to bear!\r\nیَا رَآدَّ یُوْسُفَ عَلٰی یَعْقُوْبَ \r\nYAA RAAADDA YUSUFA A’LAA YA’QOOBA\r\nO He Who returned Yusuf to Yaqoob!\r\nیَا كَاشِفَ ضُرِّ اَیُّوْبَ \r\nYAA KAASHEFA ZURRE AYYOOBA \r\nO He Who removed the affliction of Ayyub!\r\nیَا غَافِرَ ذَنْبِ دَاوٗدَ \r\nYAA GHAAFERA ZANBE DAAWOODA \r\nO He Who forgave the sin of Dawood!\r\nیَا رَافِعَ عِیْسَی بْنِ مَرْیَمَ وَ مُنْجِیَهٗ مِنْ اَیْدِی الْیَهُوْدِ \r\nYAA RAAFE’A EE’SABNE MARYAMA WA MUNJEYAHOO MIN AYDIL YAHOODE \r\nO He Who caused Eesaa, the son of Mariyam, to ascend and delivered him from the hands of the Jews!\r\nیَا مُجِیْبَ نِدَآءِ یُوْنُسَ فِی الظُّلُمَاتِ \r\nYAA MOJEEBA NEDAAE YUNUSA FIZ ZOLOMAATE \r\nO He Who answered Yunus’s call in the darkness!\r\nیَا مُصْطَفِیَ مُوْسٰی بِالْكَلِمَاتِ \r\nYAA MUSTAFEYA MOOSA BILKALEMAATE \r\nO He Who chose Moosa by spoken words!\r\nیَا مَنْ غَفَرَ لِآدَمَ خَطِیْئَتَهٗ \r\nYAA MAN GHAFARA LE-AADAMA KHATEE-ATAHU \r\nO He Who forgave Adam his slip\r\nوَ رَفَعَ اِدْرِیْسَ مَكَانًا عَلِیًّا بِرَحْمَتِهٖ \r\nWA RAFA-A IDREESA MAKAANAN ALIYAN BERAHMATEHI\r\nand raised Idr¢s to a high place through his mercy!\r\nیَا مَنْ نَجّٰی نُوْحًا مِنَ الْغَرَقِ \r\nYAA MAN NAJAA NUHAN MINAL GHARAQE \r\nO He Who saved Nooh from drowning!\r\nیَا مَنْ اَهْلَكَ عَادًا الْاُوْلٰی \r\nYAA MAN AHLAKA AADA NIL OOLAA \r\nO He Who destroyedd, the ancient,\r\nوَ ثَمُوْدَ فَمَا اَبْقٰی \r\nWA SAMOODA FAMAA ABQAA \r\nand Samood, and did not spare them,\r\nوَ قَوْمَ نُوْحٍ مِّنْ قَبْلُ \r\nWA QAWMA NUHIN MIN QABLO \r\nand the people of Nooh before;\r\nاِنَّهُمْ كَانُوْا هُمْ اَظْلَمَ وَ اَطْغٰی \r\nINNAHUM KANOO HUM AZLAMA WA ATGHA \r\ncertainly, they were most unjust and more rebellious,\r\nوَ الْمُؤْتَفِكَۃَ اَهْوٰی \r\nWAL MOTAFEKATE AHWAA \r\nand al-Mo’tafekah, He also overthrew.\r\nیَا مَنْ دَمَّرَ عَلٰی قَوْمِ لُوْطٍ \r\nYAA MAN DAMMARA ALAA QAWME LOOTIN \r\nO He Who destroyed the people of Lot\r\nوَّ دَمْدَمَ عَلٰی قُوْمِ شُعَیْبٍ \r\nWA DAMDAMA A’LAA QAWME SHO-AYBIN \r\nand crushed the people of Shoaib!\r\nیَا مَنِ اتَّخَذَ اِبْرَاهِیْمَ خَلِیْلًا \r\nYAA MANITKHAZA IBRAHEEMA KHALEELAN \r\nO He Who took Ibrahim for a friend!\r\nیَا مَنِ اتَّخَذَ مُوْسٰی كَلِیْمًا \r\nYAA MANIT TAKHAZA MOOSAA KALEEMAN \r\nO You Who took Moosa for an object of His words,\r\nوَ اتَّخَذَ مُحَمَّدًا صَلَّی اللهُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ وَ عَلَیْهِمْ اَجْمَعِیْنَ حَبِیْبًا \r\nWAT TAKHAZO MOHAMMADAN SALLAL LAAHO A’LAIHE WAA AALEHI WA A’LAYHIM AJMA’EENA HABEEBAN \r\nand took Muhammad, may Allah bless him and his Household, for a beloved!\r\nیَا مُؤْتِیَ لُقْمَانَ الْحِكْمَۃَ \r\nYAA MOATEYA LUQMAANAL HIKMATA \r\nO He Who gave Luqman wisdom,\r\nوَ الْوَاهِبَ لِسُلَیْمَانَ مُلْكًا \r\nWAL WAAHEBA LESOLAIMAANA MULKAL \r\nand bestowed upon Sulaiman a kingdom\r\nلَا یَنْبَغِیْ لِاَحَدٍ مِّنْ بَعْدِهٖ \r\nLAA YANBAGHEE LE-AHADIN MIN BA’DEHI \r\nsuch as may not befit anyone after him!\r\nیَا مَنْ نَصَرَ ذَا الْقَرْنَیْنِ عَلَی الْمُلُوْكِ الْجَبَابِرَۃِ \r\nYAA MAN NASARA ZAL QARNAINE A’LAL MULOOKIL JABAABERATE \r\nO He Who gave Zul-Qarnayn victory over the tyrannical kings!\r\nیَا مَنْ اَعْطَی الْخِضْرَ الْحَیٰوۃَ \r\nYAA MAN A’ATAL KHIZRAL HAYAATA \r\nO He Who gave al-Khizr (eternal) life\r\nوَ رَدَّ لِیُوْشَعَ بْنِ نُوْنٍ الشَّمْسَ بَعْدَ غُرُوْبِهَا \r\nWA RADDA LE-YOOSHA IBNE NOONISH SHAMSA BA’DA GHUROOBEHAA \r\nand returned the sun to Yoosha’, the son of Noon, after its setting!\r\nیَا مَنْ رَبَطَ عَلٰی قَلْبِ اُمِّ مُوْسٰی \r\nYAA MAN RABATA A’LAA QALBE UMME MOOSA \r\nO He Who strengthened the heart of Moosa’s mother,\r\nوَ اَحْصَنَ فَرْجَ مَرْیَمَ ابْنَتِ عِمْرَانَ \r\nWA AHSANA FARJA MARYAMAB NATE I’MRAANA \r\nand guarded the virginity of Maryam, the daughter of Imraan!\r\nیَا مَنْ حَصَّنَ یَحْییَ بْنَ زَكَرِیَّا مِنَ الذَّنْبِ \r\nYAA MAN HASSANA YAHYABNA ZAKAREEYAA MENAZ ZANBE \r\nO He Who fortified Yahya, the son of Zakariyya, against sins\r\nوَ سَكَّنَ عَنْ مُوْسَی الْغَضَبَ \r\nWA SAKKANA A’N MOOSAL GHAZABA \r\nand calmed the anger of Moosa!\r\nیَا مَنْ بَشَّرَ زَكَرِیَّا بِیَحْیٰی \r\nYAA MAN BASHSHARA ZAKARIYYAA BEYAHYAA \r\nO He Who gave Zakariyya the good news of the birth of Yahya!\r\nیَا مَنْ فَدَا اِسْمٰعِیْلَ مِنَ الذَّبْحِ بِذِبْحٍ عَظِیْمٍ \r\nYAA MAN FADAA ISMAA-EELA MENAZ ZABHE BEZIBHIN A’ZEEMIN \r\nO He Who ransomed Ismaeel from the sacrifice with a mighty sacrifice!\r\nیَا مَنْ قَبِلَ قُرْبَانَ هَابِیْلَ \r\nYAA MAN QABELA QURBAANA HAABEELA \r\nO He Who accepted the sacrifice of Haabeel\r\nوَ جَعَلَ الَّعْنَۃَ عَلٰی قَابِیْلَ \r\nWA JA’ALAL LA’NATA A’LAA QAABEELA \r\nand placed a curse upon Qaabeel!\r\nیَا هَازِمَ الْاَحْزَابِ لِمُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّی اللهُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ \r\nYAA HAAZEMAL AHZAABE LE MOHAMMADIN SALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WAA AALEHI \r\nO He Who routed the parties for Muhammad, may Allah bless him and his Household!\r\nصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \r\nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \r\nBless Muhammad, the household of Muhammad,\r\nوَّ عَلٰی جَمِیْعِ الْمُرْسَلِیْنَ وَ مَلَآئِكَتِكَ الْمُقَرَّبِیْنَ \r\nWA A’LAA JAMEE-IL MURSALEENA WA MALAA-EKATEKAL MOQARRABEENA \r\nall the messengers, Your archangels,\r\nوَ اَهْلِ طَاعَتِكَ اَجْمَعِیْنَ \r\nWA AHLE TAA-ATEKA AJMA-E'ENA \r\nand all those who obey You!\r\nوَ اَسْئَلُكَ بِكُلِّ مَسْئَلَۃٍ سَئَلَكَ بِهَا اَحَدٌ \r\nWA ASALOKA BEKULLE MAS-ALATIN SA-ALAKA BEHAA AHADUM \r\nI beseech You the supplication of every one who has besought you\r\nمِّمَّنْ رَضِیْتَ عَنْهُ فَحَتَمْتَ لَهٗ عَلَی الْاِجَابَۃِ \r\nMIMMAN RAZEETA A'NHO FAHATAMTA LAHO A’LAL EJAABATE \r\nand with whom You have been pleased and thus decided to grant his request.\r\nیَا اَللهُ یَا اَللهُ یَا اَللهُ \r\nYAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO YAA ALLAAHO \r\nO Allah! O Allah! O Allah!\r\nیَا رَحْمٰنُ یَا رَحْمٰنُ یَا رَحْمٰنُ \r\nYAA RAHMAANO YAA RAHMAANO YAA RAHMAANO \r\nO All-merciful! O All-merciful! O All-merciful!\r\nیَا رَحِیْمُ یَا رَحِیْمُ یَا رَحِیْمُ \r\nYAA RAHEEMO YAA RAHEEMO \r\nO All-compassionate! O All-compassionate! O All-compassionate!\r\nیَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَالْاِكْرَامِ یَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَ الْاِكْرَامِ یَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَ الْاِكْرَامِ \r\nYAA ZALJALAALE WAL IKRAAME YAA ZALJALAALE WAL IKRAAME \r\nYAA ZAL JALAALE WAL IKRAAME \r\nO Lord of majesty and honor! O Lord of majesty and honor! O Lord of majesty and honor!\r\nبِهٖ بِهٖ بِهٖ بِهٖ بِهٖ بِهٖ بِهٖ \r\nBEHI BEHI BEHI BEHI BEHI BEHI BEHI\r\nBy Him! By Him! By Him! By Him! By Him! By Him! By Him!\r\nاَسْئَلُكَ بِكُلِّ اسْمٍ سَمَّیْتَ بِهٖ نَفْسَكَ \r\nASALOKA BEKULLE ISMIN SAMMAYTA BEHI NAFSAKA \r\nI beseech You by every Name with which You have named Yourself\r\nاَوْ اَنْزَلْتَهٗ فِیْ شَیْءٍ مِنْ كُتُبِكَ \r\nAW ANZALTAHU FEE SHAY-IN MIN KOTOBEKA \r\nor which You have sent down in one of Your scriptures\r\nاَوِاسْتَاْثَرْتَ بِهٖ فِیْ عِلْمِ الْغَیْبِ عِنْدَكَ \r\nAWISTASARTA BEHI FEE I’LMIL GHAIBE I’NDAKA \r\nor kept for Yourself in the knowledge of the Unseen with You,\r\nوَ بِمَعَاقَدِ الْعِزِّ مِنْ عَرْشِكَ \r\nWA BEMAAQEDIL I’ZZE MIN A'RSHEKA \r\nby the junctures of might for Your Throne,\r\nوَ بِمُنْتَهَی الرَّحْمَۃِ مِنْ كِتَابِكَ \r\nWA BE MUNTAHAR RAHMATE MIN KETAABEKA \r\nby the utmost limit of mercy from Your Book,\r\nوَ بِمَا لَوْ اَنَّ مَا فِی الْاَرْضِ مِنْ شَجَرَۃٍ اَقْلَامٌ \r\nWA BEMAA LAW ANNA MAA FIL ARZE MIN SHAJARATIN AQLAAMUN\r\nby the fact that, “though all the trees in the earth were pens\r\nوَّ الْبَحْرُ یَمُدُّهٗ مِنْ بَعْدِهٖ سَبْعَۃُ اَبْحُرٍ\r\nWAL BAHRO YAMUDDAHU MIN BA’DAHI SAB-ATO ABHORIM \r\nand the sea - seven seas after it to replenish it,\r\nمَّا نَفِدَتْ كَلِمَاتُ اللهِ \r\nMAA NAFEDAT KALEMAATUL LAAHE \r\nyet the words of Allah not be spent.\r\nاِنَّ اللهَ عَزِیْزٌ حَكِیْمٌ \r\nINNAL LAAHA A’ZEEZUN HAKEEMUN \r\nAllah is All-mighty, All-wise.”\r\nوَّ اَسْئَلُكَ بِاَسْمَآئِكَ الْحُسْنَی \r\nWA AS-ALOKA BE-ASMAA-EKAL HUSNAL \r\nAnd I beseech You by Your Most Excellent Names\r\nالَّتِیْ نَعَتَّهَا فِیْ كِتَابِكَ فَقُلْتَ \r\nLATEE NA-ATTAHAA FEE KETAABEKA FAQULTA \r\nthat You have described in Your book thus saying,\r\nوَ لِلّٰهِ الْاَسْمَآءُ الْحُسْنٰی فَادْعُوْهُ بِهَا \r\nWA LILLAAHIL AS-MAA-UL HUSNAA FAD-OO’HO BEHAA \r\n“To Allah belong the Most Excellent Names, so call Him by them!”\r\nوَ قُلْتَ اُدْعُوْنِیْ اَسْتَجِبْ لَكُمْ \r\nWA QULTA AD-OO’NEE ASTAJIB LAKUM \r\nAnd You said: “Call upon Me and I will answer you.”\r\nوَ قُلْتَ وَ اِذَا سَئَلَكَ عِبَادِیْ عَنِّیْ فَاِنِّیْ قَرِیْبٌ \r\nWA QULTA WA EZAA SA-ALAKA E’BAADEE A’NNEE FA-INNEE QAREEBUN \r\nAnd You said: “And when My servants ask you concerning Me, then surely I am very near;\r\nاُجِیْبُ دَعْوَۃَ الدَّاعِ اِذَا دَعَانِ \r\nUJEEBO DA’WATADDAAE’ EZAA DA’AANE \r\nI answer the prayer of the suppliant when he calls on Me.”\r\nوَقُلْتَ یَا عِبَادِیَ الَّذِیْنَ اَسْرَفُوْا عَلٰی اَنْفُسِهِمْ \r\nWA QULTA YAA E’BAADEYAL LAZEENA ASRAFOO A’LAA ANFOSEHIM \r\nAnd You said: “Say: O My servants who have been prodigal against yourselves;\r\nلَا تَقْنَطَوُاْ مِنْ رَّحْمَۃِ اللهِ \r\nLAA TAQNATOO MIR RAHMATIL LAAHE \r\ndo not despair of Allah's mercy.\r\nاِنَّ اللهَ یَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوْبَ جَمِیْعًا \r\nINNAL LAAHA YAGHFERUZ ZONOOBA JAMEE-A'N \r\nSurely, Allah forgives all sins.\r\nاِنَّهٗ هُوَ الْغَفُوْرُ الرَّحِیْمُ \r\nINNAHU HOWAL GHAFOORUR RAHEEMO \r\nSurely, He is the All-forgiving, the All-compassionate.”\r\nوَ اَنَا اَسْئَلُكَ یَا اِلٰهِیْ \r\nWA ANAA AS-ALOKA YAA ILAAHEE \r\nAnd I ask You, O my God,\r\nوَ اَدْعُوْكَ یَا رَبِّ \r\nWA AD-O'OKA YAA RABBE \r\nI call You, O my Lord,\r\nوَ اَرْجُوْكَ یَا سَیِّدِی \r\nWA ARJOOKA YAA SAYYEDEE \r\nI please You, O my Master,\r\nوَ اَطْمَعُ فِیْ اِجَابَتِیْ یَا مَوْلَایَ كَمَا وَعَدْتَنِیْ \r\nWA ATMA-O' FEE EJAABATEE YAA MAWLAAYA KAMAA WA A’DTANEE \r\nand I desire for You to respond to me, O my Protector, just as You have promised me—\r\nوَ قَدْ دَعَوْتُكَ كَمَا اَمَرْتَنِیْ \r\nWA QAD DA-A’WTOKA KAMAA AMARTANEE \r\nfor I have called You just as You have commanded me.\r\nفَافْعَلْ بِیْ مَا اَنْتَ اَهْلُهٗ یَا كَرِیْمُ \r\nFAF-A’L BEE MAA ANTA AHLAHU YAA KAREEMO \r\nSo, do to me what is worthy of You, O All-generous!\r\nوَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعَالِمَیْنَ \r\nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA \r\nAll praise be to Allah, the Lord of the Worlds.\r\nوَ صَلَّی اللهُ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِهٖ اَجْمَعِیْنَ.\r\nWA SALLAAHO A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WAA AALEHI AJMA-E'ENA.\r\nMay Allah bless Muhammad and his entire Household."
}
